# Local secrets for Cloudflare Workers development (`npx wrangler dev`).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored) and set your Gemini API key.
# Free-tier Gemini API keys from Google AI Studio work with zero Google Cloud Billing required.
# For production deployments, ALWAYS use `npx wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY` instead.

GEMINI_API_KEY="YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY"
